# clangd config (2026-11-19; MSVC tree since 2026-11-21, when clang builds moved to the nightly gate). The compile database
# is this checkout's own MSVC agent tree, relative to this file, so each worktree reads its own tree although Claude Code
# starts clangd from the main checkout; clangd reads its cl.exe commands in cl driver mode. Create or refresh it with
# build_agent.cmd msvc all configure (seconds; no build). docs/BUILD.md, "C++ code intelligence".
CompileFlags:
  CompilationDatabase: build-wt-msvc
